            <div class="col-lg-8 content-page-wrapper" id="content-wrapper">
                <h1>Instruments, Policies &amp; Notices (prior to 2000)</h1>

                
                

                
                <p>The BCSC uses a number of regulatory instruments to administer the requirements of British Columbia's securities laws. This website has access to&nbsp;historical instruments &amp; policies prior to 2000, including:</p>
<ul>
    <li>Historical Blanket Orders and Rulings (BOR)</li>
    <li>Historical CSA Notices</li>
    <li>Historical Local Policy Statements (LPS)</li>
    <li>Historical Notices and Interpretation Notes (NIN)</li>
</ul>

                

                
                

                
                

                
                
